# Local-only secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# In PRODUCTION these are Cloudflare Worker secrets, not vars — set with:
#   npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_TOKEN
# (the value is entered at a hidden prompt, so it never lands in shell history)
#
# Do NOT add ADMIN_TOKEN back to `vars` in wrangler.json: a var and a secret
# sharing a name collide, and deploying would overwrite the secret.

ADMIN_TOKEN=
